    "# Pivotal serve\n",
    "\n",
    "One llama-server across both T4s behind ngrok, for the owner's own repos. Inference only. It leaves after 20 idle minutes, at 11 hours, or at once when the ngrok domain is already online. Nothing restarts it.\n"
   ]
